==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*do}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{m|ine-pro|*de-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*do-}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{audio|Sr-Do.ogg|audio|lang=sh}}
* {{IPA|/dô/|lang=sh}}

====Adverb====
{{sh-adverb|head=до̏|c|do|dȍ}}

# [[only]], [[except]]
#: {{usex|ни(т)ко до ја|t=nobody but me, only me|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|не једе ништа до комад хљеба/хлеба|t=he eats nothing except a piece of bread|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# [[around]], [[approximately]]
#: {{usex|до два метра|t=around two meters|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|до 5 кила|t=around five kilograms|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# [[due to]], [[because]] of
#: {{usex|то је до хране|t=that's due to the food|lang=sh|inline=1}}

====Preposition====
